Output demo/browse.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "cd $(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)" Enter
Type "export XDG_CONFIG_HOME=$PWD/demo/.work/config XDG_CACHE_HOME=$PWD/demo/.work/cache XDG_STATE_HOME=$PWD/demo/.work/state" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Type "ossm" Enter
Sleep 2s

Sleep 1s
Type "/research"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 1s

Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 1s

Type "?"
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 500ms

Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
